{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"title","type":"text","text":"# The Frozen Stack\n\nHundreds of millions of laptops sit unused worldwide.\n\nToo slow for Windows. Too good to throw away.","x":0,"y":0,"width":400,"height":160},
		{"id":"img-ewaste","type":"file","file":"pitch/images/ewaste-components.jpg","x":0,"y":240,"width":400,"height":280},
		{"id":"problem","type":"text","text":"Corporate OS lifecycles create artificial obsolescence.\n\nA laptop from 2012 that \"can't run Windows 11\" often has perfectly functional hardware.\n\nIt's the software that failed it.","x":0,"y":600,"width":400,"height":140},
		{"id":"scale","type":"text","text":"**The Numbers:**\n\n- 100-250 million revivable laptops globally\n- 33% of old laptops kept in household drawers\n- Only 10-15% of computer e-waste recycled\n- 40+ million \"obsolete\" annually in US alone","x":0,"y":820,"width":400,"height":180},
		{"id":"institutions","type":"text","text":"Schools, NGOs, hospitals, offices—all holding machines that are \"too slow to use, too good to throw away.\"\n\nWaiting.","x":0,"y":1080,"width":400,"height":120},
		{"id":"unlock","type":"text","text":"# The Key\n\nArch Linux + DreamOS runs faster on a 2012 laptop than Windows 11 runs on 2024 hardware.\n\n**3-5 second boot** vs 30-90 seconds.","x":0,"y":1280,"width":400,"height":160},
		{"id":"agentic","type":"text","text":"But performance is just the beginning.\n\nLLM inference happens in the cloud.\n\nA revived laptop with internet has **the same AI capabilities** as a new MacBook.","x":0,"y":1520,"width":400,"height":140},
		{"id":"leapfrog","type":"text","text":"# The Leapfrog\n\nThe ascending world doesn't catch up through incremental hardware upgrades.\n\nIt skips straight to the agentic age on hardware the descending world threw away.","x":0,"y":1740,"width":400,"height":160},
		{"id":"family","type":"text","text":"# The Family Server\n\nOne laptop serves an entire household:\n\n- Parents run the server\n- Children connect via smartphones\n- Data stays in the family\n- Network of families, not isolated consumers","x":0,"y":1980,"width":400,"height":180},
		{"id":"img-school","type":"file","file":"pitch/images/kids-computer.jpg","x":0,"y":2240,"width":400,"height":280},
		{"id":"multiplier","type":"text","text":"In the ascending world:\n\n- Average household: 5-6 people\n- Strong extended family networks\n- **One laptop = 10-20 people** connected to AI\n\nThe math changes everything.","x":0,"y":2600,"width":400,"height":160},
		{"id":"distribution","type":"text","text":"# Viral Distribution\n\nDreamOS spreads via USB stick.","x":0,"y":2840,"width":400,"height":100},
		{"id":"img-usb","type":"file","file":"pitch/images/usb-stick.jpg","x":0,"y":3020,"width":400,"height":280},
		{"id":"distribution2","type":"text","text":"- No internet needed for installation\n- Every machine creates more installation media\n- AI handles technical complexity\n- Peer-to-peer. Unstoppable.","x":0,"y":3380,"width":400,"height":140},
		{"id":"immunity","type":"text","text":"x86 hardware cannot be remotely locked down.\n\n**The cat is out of the bag.**\n\nEvery laptop made in the last 20 years can run Linux. Billions of devices. Physically impossible to recall.","x":0,"y":3600,"width":400,"height":160},
		{"id":"saturation","type":"text","text":"# Saturation is Achievable\n\n**Target:** 1.2 billion households\n\n**Supply:** 100-250 million frozen laptops × hub multipliers\n\n**Result:** The stack is already sufficient.","x":0,"y":3840,"width":400,"height":160},
		{"id":"bottleneck","type":"text","text":"The bottleneck was never hardware.\n\nIt was **activation**.\n\nDreamOS is the key.","x":0,"y":4080,"width":400,"height":120},
		{"id":"value","type":"text","text":"# The Gift\n\n- Hardware unlocked: **$22-30 billion**\n- 4 billion people with agentic computing\n- Not incremental improvement\n- **Categorical change**","x":0,"y":4280,"width":400,"height":160},
		{"id":"closing","type":"text","text":"The ascending world has been waiting for permission to join the digital age.\n\nThe permission was always there.\n\n**It was just frozen.**","x":0,"y":4520,"width":400,"height":140}
	],
